WEBVTT

00:15:29.871 --> 00:15:31.412
Like, again, it's super simple.

00:15:31.412 --> 00:15:35.496
It's a super it's a very cliched idea,
but on a fundamental basis,

00:15:35.954 --> 00:15:39.371
you don't know the effect that
your actions will have

00:15:39.371 --> 00:15:41.329
on someone else who may be watching you

00:15:41.329 --> 00:15:43.121
and you never know who
may be watching you.

00:15:43.704 --> 00:15:47.037
We all fail to live up to our
highest ideals. We all do.

00:15:47.579 --> 00:15:48.579
I know I do.

00:15:48.662 --> 00:15:55.412
But aspiring towards them has effects that
we can never anticipate. And so.

00:15:56.246 --> 00:15:58.912
You may never even know
what the consequences,

00:15:59.037 --> 00:16:01.912
but you can't really go
wrong by trying. Hmm.